what DiagParse makes of a compilation's output:
  line 12 col 7 error ['x' is not declared]
  line 1 col 1 error [a program must have a program-heading]
  line 12 col 7 warning ['b' is declared here and never used]
  not a diagnostic: not of the expected form
  not a diagnostic: not of the expected form
  not a diagnostic: not of the expected form
  not a diagnostic: not of the expected form
  not a diagnostic: not of the expected form
  not a diagnostic: not of the expected form
  not a diagnostic: not of the expected form

one diagnostic as the protocol writes it:
  {"range":{"start":{"line":11,"character":6},"end":{"line":11,"character":6}},"severity":1,"source":"pascalc","message":"'x' is not declared"}
  {"range":{"start":{"line":2,"character":4},"end":{"line":2,"character":4}},"severity":2,"source":"pascalc","message":"'b' is declared here and never used"}

a byte column, as a UTF-16 code unit column:
  e-acute before the error    byte 22 -> utf-16 21
  the same line without it    byte 21 -> utf-16 21
  an astral character         byte 20 -> utf-16 18
  inside the e-acute          byte 14 -> utf-16 14
  the start of a line         byte  1 -> utf-16  1
  past the end of the line    byte  7 -> utf-16  7
  no line at all              byte  7 -> utf-16  7
  an ill-formed byte          byte  4 -> utf-16  4

and the same diagnostic under each encoding:
  utf-16 (the default)  {"range":{"start":{"line":2,"character":20},"end":{"line":2,"character":20}},"severity":1,"source":"pascalc","message":"undeclared identifier 'zz'"}
  utf-8  (negotiated)   {"range":{"start":{"line":2,"character":21},"end":{"line":2,"character":21}},"severity":1,"source":"pascalc","message":"undeclared identifier 'zz'"}

and the notification that carries them:
  {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"textDocument/publishDiagnostics","params":{"uri":"file:///tmp/hello.pas","diagnostics":[{"range":{"start":{"line":11,"character":6},"end":{"line":11,"character":6}},"severity":1,"source":"pascalc","message":"'x' is not declared"},{"range":{"start":{"line":2,"character":0},"end":{"line":2,"character":0}},"severity":2,"source":"pascalc","message":"a second one"}]}}
